    "excerpt": "Buying when the price breaks above the highest high of the last N days \u2026 Exiting when the price drops below the lowest low of the last M days \u2026 We used a 15-day high for entry and a 15-day low for exit, rather than the typical 20-day period. \u2026 we chose to only allow trades when the ADX(14) was below 25 \u2026 Backtest results on daily BTC/USD data from 2015 showed a strong Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) of 90%",
